  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power Sector Sustainability and Efficiency Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para la Sostenibilidad y Eficiencia del Sector Electrico II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es apoyar al Gobierno de Repblica Dominicana (GDR) en laadopcin e implementacin de las reformas y polticas sectoriales necesarias para impulsar la sostenibilidad financiera y laeficiencia operativa del sector elctrico. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer la capacidad institucional y de supervisindel sector elctrico; (ii) fortalecer la planificacin y regulacin sectorial; y (iii) apoyar la mejora gerencial y operativa de las empresas de distribucin elctrica.La presente operacin de prstamo es la segunda de tres consecutivas de un solo desembolso cada una, vinculadas tcnicamente entre s, pero financiadas en forma independiente bajo la modalidad de Prstamo Programtico de Apoyo aReformas de Poltica (PBP).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to support the Government of the Dominican Republic in adopting and implementing the sector policies and reforms necessary to promote the financial sustainability and operating efficiency of the power sector. The specific objectives are to: (i) strengthen the institutional and supervision capacity of the power sector;(ii) strengthen sector planning and regulations; and (iii) support improvement in the management and operation of electricity distribution companies.This is the second of three consecutive, single-tranche loan operations that are technically linked but financed independently under the programmatic policy-based loan modality</narrative>
  </description>
